Package: cardid
Title: Use Sports Card Information to Create Card Identifiers
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Ioannis Filippos",
           family = "Kanellopoulos",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "i.f.kanellopoulos@tilburguniversity.edu",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0062-0889"))
Description: Tools for resolving unstructured sports trading card listings into
    structured identifiers. Given the free-text title and product information of
    a basketball or baseball trading card, the package identifies (1) the player
    the card refers to and (2) the year of the card, and constructs a
    standardised card identifier that supports matching listings across
    marketplaces and over time. Developed to construct the analysis panel for
    research on the effect of non-fungible tokens on physical collectibles
    markets, and reusable for any setting requiring entity resolution of
    marketplace listing text.
